      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This place is special. Its waters not entirely real, thus not visible to Bartleby - a blindspot in reality.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-DREAM_115.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Old One used them as the fuel for his Synthesizer, and to conceal his great crime from all but me.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-DREAM_116.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I was young then, driven by crusade and rhetoric. The Arkanum was supposed to dive into the Spiral's forbidden secrets, to learn the unlearnable...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-DREAM_117.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "When the Cabal left, both groups felt emptied. The Arcanum lost its zeal for exploration. The Cabal gained a hunger for power.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-DREAM_118.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-DREAM-NPC04-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "What's done is done. It's time now to put things right.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Judge_Veg_WL-DREAM_086.mp3",
